   "textLength": 959,
   "text": "Esma Livermore is a Bigambul woman, working for Reconciliation Australia, the country’s lead body for reconciliation.\nShe recommends looking for learning opportunities as a family.\nStart from activities that are educational, but also fun and easy to access, like a TV show.\n“NITV have a range of programmes that share Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander stories, cultures, histories and contemporar",
