   "textLength": 810,
   "text": "Beyond the screen, you can look for family-friendly events and activities hosted by Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander organisations in your local area. Check out your local council events and reach out to your closest Local Aboriginal Land Council for what’s happening in your area.\nThere are two main occasions to watch out for annually, Ms Livermore says: NAIDOC Week in the first week of July ",
