   "text": "It’s easy to access educational resources online to help your child learn about First Nations history, cultures and perspectives.\nSBS Learn has a range of such content, tailored to the Australian curriculum, from Foundation to Year 12, that families can explore at home.\nAt Reconciliation Australia, Ms Livermore is a manager in the Narragunnawali: Reconciliation in Education program.\nThe program of",
